msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-planner.rst:89
#: fb8b7b665e3d478f953f2c12da162c55
msgid "Mission Planner's *Survey (Grid)* option automatically defines the waypoints required to cover an arbitrary polygon, and sets ``DO_SET_CAM_TRIGG_DIST`` on relevant waypoints to ensure that pictures are captured at regular intervals in the vehicle's path."
msgstr ""

